            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Draftava 1.3.12

- Improves typing responsiveness in longer drafts by reducing unnecessary Markdown formatting and layout work.
- Fixes Obsidian captures opening an additional Draftava window instead of reusing the existing one.
- Fixes Ideas remaining faded after a drag, cancellation, or Undo.

Existing projects, iCloud safeguards, and Sparkle updates remain supported.
]]></description>
